WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.856
Brian: I can’t believe Brenda is moving.

2
00:00:05.857 --> 00:00:09.054
Ricky: Do you think she will forget

3
00:00:09.055 --> 00:00:13.403
us? Brian: I hope

4
00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:16.374
not. Ricky: I know! Let’s give her a

5
00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:27.505
present. Then she will always remember us.

6
00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:30.355
Mom: What are you looking for, Ricky?

7
00:00:30.356 --> 00:00:32.789
Ricky: Something for

8
00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.420
Brenda. I want her to never forget me.

9
00:00:36.421 --> 00:00:39.811
Mom: I’m sure she won’t.

10
00:00:39.812 --> 00:00:47.775
Ricky: Where is it? I know it’s in here.

11
00:00:47.776 --> 00:00:56.137
This is perfect for Brenda. Brian:

12
00:00:56.138 --> 00:01:02.715
Here, Brenda. I want you to have this.

13
00:01:02.716 --> 00:01:05.405
Brenda: Thank you, Brian.

14
00:01:05.406 --> 00:01:08.401
Ricky: And this is from me.

15
00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:12.687
It’s very special to me. Brenda:

16
00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:15.807
What’s inside? Ricky:

17
00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:24.897
My bug collection.

18
00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:29.345
Brenda: Good-bye, Ricky! Good-bye, Brian!

19
00:01:29.346 --> 00:01:31.474
Brian: Stay in touch!

20
00:01:31.475 --> 00:01:41.313
Ricky: We’ll miss you!

